<title>BELGIUM: BBL CUTS INVESTMENT LOAN INTEREST RATES.</title>
<headline>BBL CUTS INVESTMENT LOAN INTEREST RATES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Banque Bruxelles Lambert</p>
<p>SA said on Thursday it would cut interest rates on</p>
<p>investment loans from Friday February 21.</p>
<p>    FACILITY		    NEW RATE   OLD RATE</p>
<p>    Three year rate	   5.40 pct   5.45</p>
<p>    Five year rate	    6.30 pct   6.50</p>
<p>    Ten year rate	     7.15 pct   7.45</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
